WEBVTT

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:35.360
EPISODE 5
FLEETING SCARS

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.780
Jeez, you still have something—

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.250
Made it in time!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:54.920
<i>Buy time for me!
I'll join you guys in three minutes!</i>

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.180
She's gone?

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.560
<i>Is there a mirror anywhere near there?</i>

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.730
A mirror?

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.020
<i>That thing comes and goes
through infinity mirrors!</i>

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.920
She got away.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.670
Can you stop with
that disgusting fighting style of yours?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.180
That's what you're going to say
to someone who saved your life?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.190
Well, you saved me for now.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:51.940
Oh...

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.440
That thing was purchased COD.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:54.440
Huh?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.360
This is Bayron City Express.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.900
Huh?

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.530
KATSUYA
OPEN 24 HOURS

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.030
They're done treating Miss Yugiri.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:07.040
She's currently en route to the shelter
prepared for her by the Anti-Demon Bureau.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.450
I see.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.670
Wasn't relying on others
the right thing to do?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:16.670
If you'd been fussy and insisted on helping her
yourself, it would've been too late, wouldn't it?

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.010
But that aside...

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.930
please don't hesitate and eat up.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.470
This is my treat.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.930
Why such a strange turn of events?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.640
I actually have something
I want to ask you about.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.060
Tonight's Demon Hazard...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.810
How did you get information
about it so quickly?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.440
Well, I'm running a business here,

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.570
so I can't just disclose
where I get my information!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.490
Listen here.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:51.370
I was onsite in less than 15 minutes after confirming
the appearance of the Demonically Possessed

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.670
and informing my superiors.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.250
That was too soon for informants around the city
to catch on to it through leaks.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.760
In other words, this has to be
none other than insider information.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.390
And it has to be a leak
from the top tier, even.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.810
Here's some food and extra clothes.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.440
Why aren't you looking over here?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.440
I was told to not put
a reflection of you onto my eyes.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.950
They said I might be captured
by a demon if I did.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:31.330
YUMMY
BEAN SPROUTS

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.910
Popping out from an infinity mirror

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.330
is pretty old-fashioned
for a demon to do.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.500
Well, you're going to be quarantined
here for a while.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.210
It seems like that thing has
quite a grudge against you.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:41.010
Such unjustified resentment...
If your guy was that important to you...

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:45.590
get a good hold of him
before some demon tempts him.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.260
Don't you feel so hopeless saying that?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.020
I hear you had another argument with Shu.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.060
Sheesh, it's because that guy
keeps clinging to the past!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.570
Let me tell you a slightly old tale.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.900
On September 23rd 12 years ago,

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:07.950
in the world's first Orgonium mine
on the ocean floor to the east of Bayron City,

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.410
there was an explosion
of unknown reasons.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.620
53 lives were lost.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.830
And the mining of Orgonium
had stopped for 10 months.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.000
That's in textbooks and stuff.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.710
But as you're fully aware, this is...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.800
a superficial story
fabricated by the City Government.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.140
The truth goes like this.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.730
There was an inspection planned
for that day at the mine

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.900
with higher-ranking City Police
and government officials tagging along.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:48.160
Problems have existed since the City's founding,
caused by people who turned into superhumans.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.030
They were dubbed "Demon Hazards."

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.160
A disaster prevention consultant
named Mr. Isamu Ogata had claimed

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:58.000
they were caused by Orgonium, and at his
strong suggestion this inspection happened.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:03.250
My dad had told me back then that at the rate
they were going, it'd be less than a year

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.260
before the City became paradise for demons.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:12.930
His strong sense of impending crisis led the
government to decide to perform an investigation.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:13.760
And...

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.350
that's when that tragedy happened.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.100
Isn't that so?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:27.490
Well, as the sole survivor of that incident,
I may be preaching to the choir.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:34.740
Along with all the other attendees,
his father, mother and his beloved little sister

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.160
were instantaneously sucked
into the depths of the ocean.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:44.130
Why was Shu there? He'd still be
a young boy 12 years ago, right?

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.670
That day was supposed to be
just an inspection.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.890
So only the minimum number
of police personnel accompanied them,

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.350
and many participants
brought their families.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.430
People say it felt more like a field trip.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.100
So, what ultimately happened at the mine?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.150
Who knows?

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.860
What do you mean, who knows?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.360
Even the person who was actually there

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:09.200
is shaving his life in search
of finding the truth about that day.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:14.280
This isn't something we, the ones who didn't
accompany them to the site, arbitrarily decide.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:21.170
Even then, those involved and the families of
the deceased wanted an easily identifiable culprit.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.960
CAUSED BY DISASTER PREVENTION
CONSULTANT'S MISJUDGMENT?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.960
EXPLOSION AT THE ORGONIUM MINE

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:26.750
In other words, the overly simple decision
of Isamu Ogata had provoked the accident,

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.840
MURDER-SUICIDE
WITH HIS FAMILY

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.840
WHAT TRIGGERED THE INCIDENT?

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.550
or he had partnered
with a demon to begin with

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.550
THE SURVIVOR
IS THE ELDEST SON
OF ISAMU OGATA

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.550
EXPLOSION AT MINE
ONE SURVIVED, EVERYONE ELSE FOUND DEAD

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:34.640
and tried to connect this city with the world
of demons as the worst betrayer ever.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.900
Nowadays, nobody is curious enough
to clear the names of your parents.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.690
Because, for the record,
it is already done and over.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.190
I know that.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.900
That's why I'm...

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:58.700
...using the information of someone
you don't know the identity of to dig for the truth.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:02.250
That may be exactly
what the other side wants you to do.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.250
And the person you believe
is your informant

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:10.050
just may as well be the demon's henchman
who framed your father.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.760
I'm fully resigned for that fate—

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.800
However...

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.970
if you were to collaborate with me,
you can find the one that's using you,

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.810
and perhaps you may even be able
to use that individual.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.350
Huh?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.230
Mr. Ogata...

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:30.610
Can you tell me all the information
you've gained so far?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.400
Instead of some individual
with an unknown face,

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.120
why don't you collaborate with me,
someone you can see?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.950
You're going to believe in me?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:46.630
Let's settle the score
about the truth behind your parents...

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.460
for the first time in 12 years.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.720
Please believe me...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.720
Mr. Detective, I... I...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.720
Crying

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.720
SMIRK...

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.760
But in any case, I didn't think that you,
Assistant Inspector, would believe in Shu's foolish...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.060
I mean, information.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:09.690
That reminds me, you've taken custody
of him for a while in the past, right?

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.860
I took care of him for about a year...

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:17.530
but back then, my daughter was sick
and my wife was fatigued from nursing.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.370
A lot of things were going on...

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.830
and Shu decided to be considerate.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.950
I see.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:31.670
Is that the guy? The suspicious one
that Shu and Ayano witnessed?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.300
Junya Hanamura.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:39.470
We'd been searching with facial recognition
based on their testimony, and he came up.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.470
I looked at the documents just now,

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.730
but he's an unsuccessful male companion
based in West Side, right?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.600
Is someone like him
collaborating with a demon?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.810
There are still many unknowns
about Demon Possession.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.150
We should go talk to him for now.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:57.110
But taking advantage of a human's weakness
to make contracts?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.740
Why'd he go through
such cumbersome tactics?

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.290
If you're going to give away
such amazing power to some other human,

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.500
he can thrash about on his own.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:11.210
We the police have limited arms
due to interference from other countries.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.380
They may have
their own circumstances, too.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.470
I hate it. Things are so tough everywhere.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.470
This must be it.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.350
Is something the matter?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.640
No, right across the street...

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.270
that's Shu's office.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:35.070
Indeed, if we let him handle everything,
we'd never find the guy.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.530
Mr. Hanamura! This is the police!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.910
Assistant Inspector...

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.590
Oh man...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.300
He died moments ago.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.510
It looks like we were one step too late.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.850
Assistant Inspector...

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.020
Look at this.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.940
"One more person," huh?

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.040
You're here again today, Mom?

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.920
There's nothing I'm particularly lacking—

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.170
H-H-Hey...

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.720
Why are you here?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.260
Ayano, your taste in loungewear
is still rather—

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.890
Mom brought these for me!
I didn't pick them!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.480
So, why are you here?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:57.570
We won the auction for this one,
so I thought I'd let you know.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.530
All right, I get it! I'm satisfied!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.740
Well then, goodbye!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.200
That's not how things go.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.700
After all, the demon is targeting you.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.490
Then what?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.700
Are you going to pester me
until the end of time?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.420
That just means you're replacing
the Demonically Possessed!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.040
Of course it won't be forever.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.960
Someday, we'll have to settle the score—

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:23.720
When will that be? And where?
Who'll do what? Why and how?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.720
C'mon!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.470
By any chance, are you drunk?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.850
Hey, Shu...

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.680
Hmm?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.310
You're not intent on giving up?

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.980
Listen up, Ayano. Detective Mikami...

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.780
...is going to find out the truth
behind the incident 12 years ago

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.780
and restore your dad's honor.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:49.330
To do that, you whittle your life away
and shave away your own memories.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.160
And even if nothing is left in the end...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.330
Yeah.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.750
I don't care.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:01.960
B-But what happens... if the result confirms
the rumors and your dad's connected with a demon?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.050
If that's the case...

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.430
I grovel with everything I've got.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:13.810
You joined AAA just to fulfill that objective?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:17.980
The president was trained by my dad
back in the police days.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.490
So she returned everything
my dad taught her right back at me.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.410
You got quite a hard training, too, right?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.530
And because she fully paid you back...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.250
you had no more need for us,
so you dumped us?

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.670
Both my mom and me...

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.000
The way you're phrasing that...

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.050
Was that the reason you were dating me?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.220
Was I a hostage so that my mom
could teach you all sorts of things?

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.050
No, it was the opposite.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:55.640
I incurred the president's wrath
and I was almost fired because I dated you.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:58.480
You were fine even if you got fired.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:03.360
If push came to shove, I would've started
a new company together with you!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:07.490
You shouldn't say that so lightly
to a guy, okay?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.620
Hey, Ayano...

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.120
Hmm?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:22.840
What I'm going to tell you now is something
I've never told anyone in the past.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.210
Something even that girl doesn't know?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.300
No, that's impossible...

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:33.470
because she can look
through every single memory you have.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.890
Your recollections and everything.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.060
Kanna might still be alive.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:48.150
My little sister who supposedly disappeared
that day with my dad and mom...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.280
might still be alive.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.790
A dream?

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.420
Isn't it hilarious? Such a weak theory...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.080
Nope.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.920
The first time I had that dream
was about three years ago.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.840
Kanna showed up in my dreams...

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.510
and was pleading for my help.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.470
Three years ago means...

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:17.310
A few months before I quit AAA.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.900
I thought it was simply me
having mental health issues,

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.530
but even now she keeps
calling out to me. And besides—

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:32.410
Some demons interfere through dreams.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.700
So perhaps,

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:39.540
she was abducted by a demon that day,
but she's still just the way she was.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:44.420
That's why I will never ever give up!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.710
I can't...

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.920
change how I live!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:51.760
All right.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:57.100
Then, I'll never stop you again,
and I'll never see you again.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.890
Wait, that means you don't get it, right?

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.390
I never said I'd never see you again—

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:07.940
Why?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.530
Because if my image
is showing in your eyes...

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.450
the demon might show up.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.120
N-No, the problem is way before that—

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.340
This is the last time.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:40.310
I won't stop you ever again.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.770
I won't interfere ever again.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.940
I'll dump you.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.110
So...

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.650
Ayano...

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.320
My gun?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.160
I didn't bring it!
Your image may have reflected onto it!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.530
O-Oh...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.660
W-Well then...

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.620
how should I support—

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.330
Don't need it! Not necessary!
Shu and I will make something of this!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.590
But Shu's gun can also—

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.090
You have no right to be worrying!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.590
So just sit tight and keep hiding!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.930
Then, one thing.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.560
Let me help you out with one thing.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.610
This isn't good.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.610
This is becoming
more and more like her home turf.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.950
Perhaps this is the price you pay
for having so much fun.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.460
I feel thorns in my back, Miss Kisara.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.210
I'm going full strength to finish this off.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.840
I see.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.710
Then can you lower that sword—

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.720
H-Hold on, Miss Kisara!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.720
You're biting my tongue!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.220
Ow, ow, ow!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.740
Shu...

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.450
Shu!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.370
Are you okay?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.620
Do you understand your current situation?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.460
My situation?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.920
Yeah.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.020
I see.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.770
So Kisara came here for me.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.490
Ayano, you stay hidden.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:43.570
This is our battle from here on!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.040
U-Um, Shu...

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.040
About that thing earlier...

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:50.870
That thing earlier?

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.920
N-Nothing.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.230
Shu!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.270
We're gonna finish this off!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.360
Officer Morgan said...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.610
you'd likely be here.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.000
No. I don't smoke.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.660
Such a waste.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.670
I offer things to people
less than once a year.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.210
Thank you for all that work yesterday.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:24.380
For now, this current incident
will come to a close.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:28.640
So, you couldn't get a statement
from that agent after all?

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:32.220
Right. The enemy was a cut above us.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.100
I see.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:37.310
So in the end,
we're back right where we started.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.980
No. It was only about two steps back.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:43.360
The enemy made a critical mistake.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:46.240
The weapon used
to murder Junya Hanamura...

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:51.910
did not coincide with that
of the Demonically Possessed, Maria Tissi.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:56.830
There were traces of skillful attempts
at disguising it though.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.210
That means...

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:03.010
It was not revenge
by the Demonically Possessed.

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:06.180
He was silenced by another human.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.010
Once again, the enemy's gotten ahead of us.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:14.980
So, it's highly likely that the mysterious informant
who's providing you with information

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:18.270
is working based on a demon's will.

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:24.690
In any case, the suspect list
has narrowed down significantly in my head.

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:36.540
I thought you were never interfering again.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:43.380
"Oh, did she say something like that?" I'm sure
that's how Shu'd answer if you asked him.

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.970
After using someone oh so much,

00:22:45.970 --> 00:22:49.130
you're going to engrave only good memories
about yourself? Isn't that a bit unfair?

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:55.980
Even then, just like I wished,
you took those memories away from Shu.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:58.730
You didn't want Shu
to remember it, did you?

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:01.110
That is, my scent.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:12.280
So anyway, Shu doesn't remember
what happened back then.

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:16.330
So I'll keep butting in,
and I'll be interfering.

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.170
Interfering with what?
Demon Extermination?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:21.210
Or...

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:25.340
Let me brag that I have
the upper hand every so often.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:00.000
EPISODE 6
THIRD-PARTY DEMON KILLER

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.160
"Third-Party Demon Killer."
